WEBVTT

00:19.703 --> 00:23.435
In the spring of that year,
the whole of Edo was reeling.

00:27.844 --> 00:29.546
Bekiemon Miyamoto:

00:29.546 --> 00:32.482
a genius who had mastered all
her studies by the young age of ten

00:32.482 --> 00:35.852
and was recently appointed the
shogunate's Commissioner of Finance,

00:35.852 --> 00:38.446
making her the youngest in history
to hold that title.

00:39.322 --> 00:44.488
This girl promulgated a new tax
on the people of Edo.

00:51.401 --> 00:52.002
Maho?

00:52.002 --> 00:52.436
Maho?

00:56.740 --> 00:58.008
"Hau Hau Tax"?

00:58.842 --> 01:04.781
Lalalalala lalalala lalalala

01:05.482 --> 01:12.047
Lalalalala lalalala lalala la la la la

01:18.328 --> 01:21.598
Party dress wa arukedo

01:21.598 --> 01:24.935
Kouen dewa uiteita

01:24.935 --> 01:28.205
Hatsuon wa tadashiku iuno

01:28.205 --> 01:31.308
"Karatto" wa "carat"

01:31.308 --> 01:34.478
Watashi wa koko ni iru

01:34.478 --> 01:37.347
Kagami ni utsutteru

01:37.347 --> 01:40.917
Sukoshi dake keshou shita

01:40.917 --> 01:44.354
Idol no Shoujo Q

01:44.354 --> 01:45.947
Shoujo Q

01:48.492 --> 01:52.629
Nazomeku otome ni minna

01:52.629 --> 01:55.132
<i>(Al ya ai ya, ya ya ya ya ya)</i>

01:55.132 --> 01:59.236
Shigeki na shisen de kageki

01:59.236 --> 02:01.738
<i>(Al ya ai ya, ya ya ya ya ya)</i>

02:01.738 --> 02:05.041
Dare ka watashi wo nakasete yo

02:05.041 --> 02:06.209
Dare ka watashi wo nakasete yo

02:08.345 --> 02:11.681
Dare ka watashi wo nakasete yo

02:11.681 --> 02:12.849
Dare ka watashi wo nakasete yo

02:29.766 --> 02:32.736
Mahoho! Welcome, customers!

02:32.736 --> 02:36.229
I'm the always-energetic fishmonger! Maybe!

02:39.776 --> 02:42.546
Oh, good afternoon, fishmonger!

02:42.546 --> 02:42.679
Oh, costume-maker! Good maho-maho!

02:42.679 --> 02:46.249
Oh, costume-maker! Good maho-maho!

02:46.249 --> 02:48.218
What's the best catch today?

02:48.218 --> 02:48.309
What's the best catch today?

02:48.552 --> 02:50.987
Today's best catch is CRAB!

02:51.354 --> 02:54.057
Wow! Is it good?

02:54.057 --> 02:54.558
It's great! It's so tasty you'll just cry!

02:54.558 --> 02:58.017
It's great! It's so tasty you'll just cry!

02:58.428 --> 03:01.261
What? Cry? I can't eat any then!

03:01.665 --> 03:03.400
Maho? Why not?

03:03.400 --> 03:03.500
Maho? Why not?

03:03.500 --> 03:06.570
Because if I cry, they'll tax me on the tears!

03:06.570 --> 03:08.071
Oh, right!

03:12.442 --> 03:13.577
She cried!

03:17.314 --> 03:18.882
You cried, didn't you, wench?!

03:18.882 --> 03:21.251
We'll be collecting the Hau Hau tax now!

03:21.251 --> 03:23.117
That's 100 yen per cry!

03:24.554 --> 03:27.324
Now you've cried twice! 200 yen!

03:27.324 --> 03:29.459
Wah! You can't mean it!

03:29.459 --> 03:30.927
That makes it 300.

03:30.927 --> 03:32.195
You're kidding!

03:32.195 --> 03:33.597
That makes it 400!

03:33.597 --> 03:35.292
Help me!

03:37.000 --> 03:39.469
Something is definitely wrong with that.

03:47.777 --> 03:50.280
Oh, Lady Miyamoto, you're so wonderful.

03:50.280 --> 03:51.815
Oh, pshaw.

03:51.815 --> 03:53.083
You're a genius, after all.

03:53.083 --> 03:54.451
Oh, pshaw.

03:54.451 --> 03:55.852
And you're cute, too.

03:55.852 --> 03:57.320
Oh, pshaw.

03:57.320 --> 03:59.652
And you think up unscrupulous taxes.

04:00.323 --> 04:02.559
WHAT did you say?

04:02.559 --> 04:03.754
Whoops, chuck that out the window.

04:04.561 --> 04:05.962
Oh, we're sorry!

04:05.962 --> 04:06.997
Please, Commissioner,

04:06.997 --> 04:08.795
lighten your mood with this!

04:09.032 --> 04:11.023
There now.

04:11.868 --> 04:13.203
Isn't it good?

04:13.203 --> 04:14.738
Yeah, it's tasty!

04:14.738 --> 04:17.440
This cake is made by the best in Edo!

04:17.440 --> 04:19.442
Yeah, it's definitely good stuff!

04:19.442 --> 04:22.512
Honestly, Yuma.

04:22.512 --> 04:24.844
Sorry, my true feelings just sort of slipped out.

04:28.285 --> 04:29.619
Hey, you.

04:29.619 --> 04:31.388
You're being called.

04:31.388 --> 04:33.390
What? Me?

04:33.390 --> 04:37.227
You mustn't let your mind wander.
This world is turning.

04:37.227 --> 04:38.662
My apologies.

04:38.662 --> 04:41.364
No, I was talking to you, shamisen player.

04:41.364 --> 04:43.366
Oh, me?

04:46.036 --> 04:47.170
Your shamisen!

04:47.170 --> 04:49.439
Don't just carry it with you; actually play it!

04:49.439 --> 04:51.841
What do you think I called you over here for?

04:51.841 --> 04:53.310
I'm expensive, you know.

04:53.310 --> 04:54.411
How much?

04:54.411 --> 04:55.779
40,000 pesetas.

04:55.779 --> 04:57.747
I don't know how much that's worth.

04:57.747 --> 04:59.282
It's a reasonable price, isn't it?

04:59.282 --> 05:01.851
I'm sorry, I don't know.

05:01.851 --> 05:06.721
Well then, I shall give you a large discount
and settle for 167 cruzado.

05:07.057 --> 05:08.558
Is that discounting myself too much?

05:08.558 --> 05:10.694
I have no idea...

05:10.694 --> 05:14.030
For goodness' sake! I'll pay whatever
you want, so hurry up and play!

05:14.030 --> 05:19.002
Oh my, whatever she wants?
Lady Miyamoto, you're such a rich girl!

05:19.002 --> 05:20.203
Oh, pshaw.

05:20.203 --> 05:22.372
Yes, since you're pocketing almost all
of the taxes you collect

05:22.372 --> 05:24.898
instead of giving them to the shogunate.

05:25.608 --> 05:27.477
WHAT did you say?

05:27.477 --> 05:29.279
Whoops, Chuck Norris that out the window.

05:29.279 --> 05:30.480
Now, now.

05:30.480 --> 05:33.984
Look, Commissioner, it's cake!

05:33.984 --> 05:36.248
There, now.

05:36.786 --> 05:38.321
Isn't it good?

05:38.321 --> 05:39.311
It's not bad!

05:39.589 --> 05:42.492
Honestly, Yuma.

05:42.492 --> 05:43.460
Sorry.

05:43.460 --> 05:46.363
Hey, what's with you? Hurry up and play.

05:46.363 --> 05:48.064
Yes, my lady. Now then...

05:48.064 --> 05:50.658
Strum... pluck pluck.

05:51.034 --> 05:51.801
Huh?

05:51.801 --> 05:53.036
Pluck pluck pluck, pluck.

05:53.036 --> 05:53.770
Huh?

05:53.770 --> 05:55.705
Pluck, pluck, pluck pluck pluck.

05:55.705 --> 05:56.433
Fwee!

05:57.540 --> 05:59.142
What's the "fwee"?

05:59.142 --> 06:00.632
A string snapped.

06:00.910 --> 06:03.580
My my. A clever touch.

06:03.580 --> 06:05.378
Thank you for listening to my poor performance.

06:05.982 --> 06:07.050
Yeah, it WAS poor.

06:07.050 --> 06:08.385
Um...

06:08.385 --> 06:10.153
What is it?

06:10.153 --> 06:12.884
What's "Chuck Norris"?

06:22.565 --> 06:24.334
Go, Papal!

06:24.334 --> 06:27.203
Take down that bad commissioner!

06:27.203 --> 06:30.774
Shhh! You idiot, don't say that so loudly!

06:30.774 --> 06:33.505
Aw, why not?

06:35.011 --> 06:36.713
Time out for a sec.

06:36.713 --> 06:38.848
Huh? What's wrong?

06:38.848 --> 06:40.216
You're heavy.

06:40.216 --> 06:42.385
Aw, this is so comfy!

06:42.385 --> 06:43.753
Go!

06:43.753 --> 06:46.089
Yeah, well, it's a lot harder doing the pushing!

06:46.089 --> 06:49.426
Get out! You're so big I know
you can walk on your own!

06:49.426 --> 06:53.897
"Big"? Oh dear! Papa, you letch!

06:53.897 --> 06:56.666
Don't go babbling crazy stuff and blushing!

06:56.666 --> 06:58.259
But...

07:05.842 --> 07:07.377
Wow.

07:07.377 --> 07:09.709
No time for "wows"! We gotta run!

07:21.858 --> 07:23.792
We're in a real bind...

07:27.230 --> 07:29.732
Seriously. I wonder if we can
leave things like this.

07:31.734 --> 07:35.105
It's what the government has decided,
so there's nothing to be done about it.

07:36.706 --> 07:39.767
Well, smiling feels better than crying anyway,

07:40.076 --> 07:44.481
and seeing the departed off
with a smile at a funeral

07:44.481 --> 07:46.483
lets them go to Heaven without
unnecessary regrets, too.

07:46.483 --> 07:48.151
You're so sensible.

07:48.151 --> 07:50.386
Basically everything depends
on your way of thinking, that's all.

07:50.386 --> 07:52.555
Here, this is done, take it on out.

07:52.555 --> 07:53.223
Okay!

07:53.223 --> 07:53.389
Okay!

07:54.791 --> 07:58.228
Thank you for waiting! One stir-fried greens,
and one tofu with ground beef and chili peppers!

07:58.228 --> 07:58.285
Thank you for waiting! One stir-fried greens,
and one tofu with ground beef and chili peppers!

07:58.795 --> 08:01.730
The tofu is spicy, so please be careful.

08:02.031 --> 08:04.834
Okay, the food is here, Elder.

08:04.834 --> 08:05.135
Okay, the food is here, Elder.

08:05.135 --> 08:06.669
"Elder"...

08:06.669 --> 08:09.072
Doesn't it look good, Elder?

08:09.072 --> 08:09.606
Doesn't it look good, Elder?

08:09.606 --> 08:12.075
Whatever I may look like,
I am sixteen years old...

08:12.242 --> 08:14.177
Your hair is white, so it's okay.

08:14.177 --> 08:14.310
Your hair is white, so it's okay.

08:14.544 --> 08:16.012
YOU'RE the elder here.

08:16.212 --> 08:18.815
Gramps, you're so careless,

08:18.815 --> 08:21.284
you must've aged in an unguarded moment.

08:21.284 --> 08:23.480
Yep, you got me.

08:25.488 --> 08:26.923
That makes no sense to me.

08:27.290 --> 08:29.459
Come to think of it, I heard this rumor...

08:29.459 --> 08:31.361
They say allies of justice from
all over the nation

08:31.361 --> 08:35.265
are gathering in Edo to make the Commissioner
abolish the Hau Hau Tax.

08:35.265 --> 08:38.735
Allies of justice? Wow, like who?

08:38.735 --> 08:41.602
Like Mito Komon.

08:42.772 --> 08:45.842
H-Here, take some, Elder. It's very good!

08:45.842 --> 08:48.106
O-Okay. I guess I'll have some.

08:50.547 --> 08:51.281
Oh, be careful Elder, that's spicy!

08:51.281 --> 08:53.082
Oh, be careful Elder, that's spicy!

08:53.082 --> 08:53.850
Unfortunately, you're too late.

08:53.850 --> 08:54.984
Unfortunately, you're too late.

08:54.984 --> 08:55.218
Unfortunately, you're too late.

08:55.285 --> 08:56.753
Oh, he cried!

08:56.753 --> 08:58.454
This is bad!

09:00.990 --> 09:02.759
We'll be exacting the Hau Hau Tax.

09:02.759 --> 09:03.726
Yes, we will!

09:03.726 --> 09:03.760
Yes, we will!

09:03.927 --> 09:03.993
So you've shown your faces,
Hau Hau bureaucrats!

09:03.993 --> 09:05.795
So you've shown your faces,
Hau Hau bureaucrats!

09:06.029 --> 09:08.464
We won't let you get away
with such a crazy tax!

09:08.464 --> 09:08.731
We won't let you get away
with such a crazy tax!

09:09.265 --> 09:10.433
You mean to oppose us?

09:10.433 --> 09:12.902
If you oppose us, you'll be arrested!

09:12.902 --> 09:13.102
If you oppose us, you'll be arrested!

09:13.102 --> 09:15.438
What?! Arrest us, you say?!

09:16.739 --> 09:19.765
A huge battle scene suddenly unfolds!

09:20.143 --> 09:22.445
The fight becomes a free-for-all,

09:22.445 --> 09:24.447
and the real swords they are
using send up sparks!

09:24.547 --> 09:27.951
All right, everyone, please hush!

09:28.184 --> 09:31.745
Just who do you think this man is?!

09:33.189 --> 09:34.490
Here it comes.

09:34.958 --> 09:36.793
Everybody back off!
Don't you see this crest...

09:36.793 --> 09:37.760
Everybody back off!
Don't you see this crest...

09:37.760 --> 09:38.494
Everybody back off!
Don't you see this crest...

09:38.494 --> 09:39.729
Everybody back off!
Don't you see this crest...

09:39.729 --> 09:41.164
Wait, I don't have it.

09:41.164 --> 09:43.866
What? Well, I don't have it.

09:43.866 --> 09:47.036
Oh, that's right. I gave it to Grandpa Careless.

09:47.036 --> 09:48.238
Grandpa, the inro!

09:48.238 --> 09:48.471
Grandpa, the inro!

09:48.471 --> 09:49.906
Inro?

09:49.906 --> 09:51.541
Hmm, inro...

09:51.541 --> 09:53.042
Oh, that.

09:53.042 --> 09:53.276
"Oh, that" my butt! Hand it over!

09:53.276 --> 09:54.644
"Oh, that" my butt! Hand it over!

09:54.644 --> 09:55.078
Hurry, Gramps!

09:55.078 --> 09:56.479
Hurry, Gramps!

09:56.479 --> 09:59.278
I pawned it yesterday.

10:00.483 --> 10:02.552
Wh-What did you say, Old Geezer?!

10:02.552 --> 10:04.687
Oh, I'm so careless.

10:04.687 --> 10:04.921
Oh, I'm so careless.

10:04.921 --> 10:07.557
That's not careless, that's calculating.

10:07.557 --> 10:12.017
All right, you bastards, come along quietly!

10:18.067 --> 10:20.126
I think we've gotten far enough away.

10:20.270 --> 10:22.238
Be more careful, would you?

10:23.139 --> 10:24.470
Sorry!

10:26.142 --> 10:29.237
Here, Father, your rice porridge is ready.

10:31.047 --> 10:31.878
Head meat!

10:32.181 --> 10:33.615
Now, take a bite.

10:36.119 --> 10:36.915
Hearts!

10:37.287 --> 10:39.722
Father, what's the matter?

10:39.722 --> 10:42.158
If you don't eat, you won't
recover your strength.

10:42.158 --> 10:43.125
Welsh onion kebab!

10:44.527 --> 10:50.500
If I could, I'd like to feed you the full-course
seasonal French meal of a three-star chef,

10:50.500 --> 10:51.901
but under these economic circumstances,

10:51.901 --> 10:54.768
even such modest dreams of the
common folk cannot come true!

10:54.937 --> 10:55.870
Neck-area meat!

10:56.172 --> 10:58.334
I'm so sorry, Father.

10:58.574 --> 10:59.439
Rump meat!

11:01.144 --> 11:03.146
She was a disciplined and stoic child.

11:03.146 --> 11:04.614
I feel so much pity...

11:04.614 --> 11:04.814
I feel so much pity...

11:04.814 --> 11:05.848
Really?

11:05.848 --> 11:08.351
All of this is because of that tax!

11:08.351 --> 11:10.219
I think this particular case is different.

11:10.219 --> 11:15.055
Miss, your humble servant will overthrow that
evil commissioner with her own hands, just watch!

11:16.526 --> 11:17.894
Hau Hau Tax!

11:17.894 --> 11:19.062
Time to collect!

11:19.062 --> 11:22.398
You dirty bureaucrats! I've got no money
I'm willing to pay to YOU!

11:22.398 --> 11:23.797
Leave my sight at once!

11:24.033 --> 11:26.669
A huge battle scene suddenly unfolds!

11:26.669 --> 11:27.898
...I'll skip the rest.

11:28.905 --> 11:30.707
Why are you arresting me too?

11:30.707 --> 11:32.942
Papa! Wait!

11:32.942 --> 11:35.478
This thing won't stand up
if you don't hold your end!

11:35.478 --> 11:36.707
Check, please.

11:43.686 --> 11:46.417
Nothing will be settled at this rate.

11:48.925 --> 11:52.884
Episode 24
"You Are Responsible for Your Own Death”

11:56.499 --> 11:58.935
We take care of the bad kids
who think they can do whatever they like.

11:58.935 --> 12:01.437
We are not waiting for parental
punishment to befall them.

12:01.437 --> 12:03.940
Television's justice is not
to be relied upon either.

12:03.940 --> 12:06.910
In darkness we judge them
and paniponi them.

12:08.511 --> 12:09.946
Namu Amida Butsu.

12:09.946 --> 12:10.713
Kurumi Drawn Becky
Namu Amida Butsu.

12:13.716 --> 12:16.651
NO NEED FOR GENIVSES

12:17.587 --> 12:19.689
It's Nezumi! It's Nezumi Kozo!

12:19.689 --> 12:19.856
It's Nezumi! It's Nezumi Kozo!

12:19.956 --> 12:20.990
He's running over there! Capture him!

12:20.990 --> 12:22.185
He's running over there! Capture him!

12:32.969 --> 12:34.837
I'm sure he's in this area...

12:35.138 --> 12:36.333
So THIS is where you are, Nezumi?!

12:38.107 --> 12:39.208
Good evenin', sir!

12:39.208 --> 12:39.909
Good evenin', sir!

12:39.909 --> 12:41.177
Who the heck are you?

12:41.177 --> 12:43.946
I'm Nezumi. You a-makin' an arrest?

12:43.946 --> 12:45.914
Yes. He just ran this way...

12:48.284 --> 12:49.385
Y-You stink!

12:49.385 --> 12:52.288
Eh? I'm a-stinkin'? That's funny...

12:52.288 --> 12:55.024
I took a bath last month
like a good man always does...

12:55.024 --> 12:57.760
Gah! You stink so much I can't stand it!

12:57.760 --> 12:59.128
Come on, let's go!

12:59.128 --> 13:01.324
He's not here!
He's over there, over there!

13:01.497 --> 13:03.659
Do I really stink that much?

13:05.268 --> 13:07.437
Heh. Now then...

13:07.437 --> 13:07.670
Nezumi Kozo.

13:07.670 --> 13:07.870
Nezumi Kozo.

13:07.870 --> 13:08.070
Nezumi Kozo.

13:08.070 --> 13:08.204
Nezumi Kozo.

13:08.204 --> 13:08.538
Nezumi Kozo.

13:08.538 --> 13:09.338
Who is it?!

13:09.338 --> 13:09.539
Over here.

13:09.539 --> 13:09.739
Over here.

13:09.739 --> 13:09.939
Over here.

13:09.939 --> 13:10.337
Over here.

13:22.685 --> 13:23.686
You guys...

13:23.686 --> 13:26.917
We got arrested because of that tax.

13:29.258 --> 13:32.361
It's so pathetic, my storm of
cherry blossoms is crying too.

13:32.361 --> 13:34.897
Even you... I'll break you
out of here right away!

13:34.897 --> 13:37.867
Not possible. Security's really tight.

13:37.867 --> 13:39.068
Then what...

13:39.068 --> 13:40.369
I want you to do me a favor.

13:43.573 --> 13:44.841
"Paniponin"?

13:44.841 --> 13:44.874
Yes. I want them to avenge us...
To avenge the people of Edo.

13:44.874 --> 13:45.374
Yes. I want them to avenge us...
To avenge the people of Edo.

13:45.374 --> 13:48.177
Yes. I want them to avenge us...
To avenge the people of Edo.

13:48.177 --> 13:48.744
Yes. I want them to avenge us...
To avenge the people of Edo.

13:48.744 --> 13:50.337
Yes. I want them to avenge us...
To avenge the people of Edo.

13:50.780 --> 13:52.615
Will you do it for me?

13:52.615 --> 13:54.584
All right. Leave it to me.

13:54.584 --> 13:55.785
I owe you one.

13:55.785 --> 13:58.482
But there's just one problem.

13:59.956 --> 14:01.257
Cash.

14:01.257 --> 14:04.393
The guard took all the money I had on me.

14:06.729 --> 14:10.733
Heh, that's the problem? Well, don't worry then.

14:10.733 --> 14:12.001
If it's money we need...

14:12.001 --> 14:12.968
I got it.

14:13.402 --> 14:15.471
The matter has my full understanding.

14:25.381 --> 14:27.975
All right, we'll start
this punishment at one million.

14:28.584 --> 14:29.847
950,000!

14:30.987 --> 14:32.421
900,000.

14:33.656 --> 14:34.524
850,000!

14:34.524 --> 14:35.491
800,000!

14:37.126 --> 14:37.922
50 yen!

14:39.795 --> 14:41.388
50 yen...

14:42.398 --> 14:45.535
The winning bid for this punishment is 50 yen.

14:50.873 --> 14:51.669
50 yen is...

14:54.343 --> 14:56.209
50 yen is kind of ridiculous.

14:57.380 --> 14:58.176
That's so under...

15:00.816 --> 15:02.985
It's the so underselling of the year.

15:03.152 --> 15:07.555
Oh, shut up! I didn't want to let
another team do this one!

15:09.692 --> 15:12.795
The Commissioner of Finance,
Bekiemon Miyamoto...

15:12.795 --> 15:14.854
She's apparently quite the genius.

15:15.231 --> 15:15.898
Genius...

15:18.568 --> 15:22.505
I don't care whether she's a genius or not;
what she does is too harsh.

15:22.505 --> 15:26.373
And here I thought the little
commissioner was cute!

15:28.644 --> 15:30.134
It's the tipster.

15:31.013 --> 15:33.382
Thanks for your work. What's the situation?

15:33.382 --> 15:36.686
What a question. At this point
the situation's just crazy.

15:40.056 --> 15:41.991
Oh, there's a picture book on the ground.

15:45.127 --> 15:46.390
I feel so sorry for her!

